{comment: Verse 1 & 2}
[Bm7]Open up our eyes, Lord, we want to [Dsus]see  Y[D]ou
Open the gates, Lord, reveal Your glory
[A]Open our hearts, Lord  we want to k[G]now You
Open the nations, establish Your kingdom
[Bm7]Open our ears, Lord we need to [Dsus]hear Y[D]ou
Open up the heavens, pour out Your Spirit
[A]Jesus be revealed,   Je[G]sus be rev[D]ealed

{comment: Chorus}
God is h[D]ere, God is [Am7]here    God is [Bm7]here, He is[D] able
We draw [D/F#]near to see J[G]esus face to f[Bm7]ace[A]
God is h[D]ere, God is [Am7]here    God is h[Bm7]ere, He is fa[D]ithful
